es nothing special and there is little depth.\n\n\nConclusion:\nWorth it on the cheap to waste time with. But in the current state anything over 20 EUR is wasted money.\nMight improve with some more updates. I may revisit it eventually.", "timestamp_created": 1706632121, "timestamp_updated": 1706632121, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 39, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.576949179172515869", "comment_count": 7, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1682985798", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 13, "count": 1}, {"reaction_type": 19, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": "157143664", "author": {"steamid": "76561198018847546", "personaname": "sarulon", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198018847546/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 4, "playtime_forever": 2275, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2275, "last_played": 1706216778, "avatar": "fef49e7fa7e1997310d705b2a6158ff8dc1cdfeb"}, "language": "english", "review": "fun game, very good idea , need some fixes but still enjoyed this game", "timestamp_created": 1706560705, "timestamp_updated": 1706560705, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.402339071035385132", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1682985798", "reactions": []}]}